+
+Proves that EVERY non-VERIFIED or correlated identity failure yields:
+NO VERIFIED IDENTITY / IDENTITY CORRELATION FAILURE -> NO CEDAR ALLOW -> NO TOKEN ALLOW -> NO LEDGER PREPARE.
+"""
